// Incident 01 — SSH Brute-Force Detection & Investigation
// Replace this starter logic with the query that matches the actual table/schema
// after the Ubuntu SSH logs are successfully ingested into Microsoft Sentinel.

// Investigation goals:
// 1. Identify repeated failed SSH authentication attempts.
// 2. Aggregate attempts by source IP and targeted account.
// 3. Measure activity in a short time window.
// 4. Check whether a successful authentication followed the failures.

// Starter pattern only — validate field names against your environment.
Syslog
| where SyslogMessage has "Failed password"
| summarize FailedAttempts = count()
    by Computer, bin(TimeGenerated, 5m)
| where FailedAttempts >= 10
| order by FailedAttempts desc
